[program:acme-loop]
Runs node loop.js as you. Starts with supervisord, restarts it whenever it exits, and gives it 10 seconds to stop. Output goes to an auto-named file in supervisord's log folder. Errors go to /var/log/acme/loop.err.
! acme-loop: startsecs=0 with autorestart on, so a crash loop burns through its 5 retries in seconds.
